      &lt;p&gt;in that place. In the absence of an unequivocal list it might be impossible for the licensee to determine
         what is considered by you to comprise The Program.&lt;/p&gt;

      &lt;p&gt;Noting Exceptional Files If The Program contains any files bearing additional conditions on modification,
