      &lt;&lt;var;name="bullet";original="1.8.";match=".{0,20}"&gt;&gt;
      "Worker" is defined to include any and all permanent, temporary, and agency workers, as well as piece-rate, salaried, hourly paid, legal young (minors), part-time, night, and migrant workers.

