&lt;li&gt;&lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; ii)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; as part of the normal distribution of a tool used to design or Make the Product.&lt;/li&gt;
                  
&lt;/ul&gt;
                &lt;/li&gt;
              
