    <rdfs:comment>This license is essentially a rebranded version of MPL-1.1, but with some important changes. The added §7.1 expands on the warranty disclaimer. The change in §11 moves the forum and the jurisdiction to Victoria, Australia (from California, USA in MPL-1.1). Section 3.7 of this license contains the word "LEDs" which appears to be a typo in the upstream version, at https://directory.fsf.org/wiki/License:NOSL. It is retained here as optional text, so that it will still match in case others have used the license text with this typo.</rdfs:comment>
