&lt;li&gt;
				&lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; 4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt;
				COMMERCIAL DISTRIBUTION
				&lt;p&gt;Commercial
					distributors of software may accept certain
					responsibilities
					with
					respect to end users, business partners and the
					like. While this
					license is intended to facilitate the commercial
					use of the
