				&lt;p&gt;Simply including a copy of this Agreement, including this Exhibit
					A
					is not sufficient to license the Source Code under Secondary
					Licenses.
				&lt;/p&gt;

				&lt;p&gt;If it is not possible or desirable to put the notice in a
