         Recipient relating to the Program shall continue and survive.&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;p&gt;
               &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .+"&gt; &amp;lt;OWNER&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; may publish new versions (including revisions) of this
