      &lt;p&gt;
        &lt;var class="optional-license-text"&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/var&gt;one line to give the program&amp;apos;s name and &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern a brief|an"&gt; an&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; idea of what it does.&lt;var class="optional-license-text"&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/var&gt;
