           the software development community for the electronic transfer of data.&lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Executable&amp;quot; shall mean Covered Software in any form other than Source Code.&lt;/p&gt;

        &lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Nokia&amp;quot; shall mean Nokia Corporation and its Affiliates.&lt;/p&gt;

