   &lt;&lt;var;name="bullet";original="5.";match=".{0,20}"&gt;&gt; Don't waste. Anything, but specially energy that comes from natural non-renewable resources. Extra points if you discover or invent something to replace them.
   &lt;&lt;var;name="bullet";original="6.";match=".{0,20}"&gt;&gt; Be tolerant. Everything that's good in nature comes from cooperation.</spdx:standardLicenseTemplate>
