                &lt;/li&gt;
                
&lt;li&gt;
                    &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; 4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; Conveying Verbatim Copies.
                    &lt;p&gt;
You may convey verbatim copies of the Program&amp;apos;s source code as you receive it, in any medium, provided that you conspicuously and appropriately publish on each copy an appropriate copyright notice; keep intact all notices stating that this License and any non-permissive terms added in accord with section 7 apply to the code; keep intact all notices of the absence of any warranty; and give all recipients a copy of this License along with the Program.&lt;/p&gt;

                    &lt;p&gt;
You may charge any price or no price for each copy that you convey, and you may offer support or warranty protection for a fee.&lt;/p&gt;

