&lt;li&gt;
                    &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; 10.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; Automatic Licensing of Downstream Recipients.
