                    &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; 17.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; Interpretation of Sections 15 and 16.
                    &lt;p&gt;
