    <spdx:licenseTextHtml>
	&lt;div class="optional-license-text"&gt; 
		&lt;p&gt;Minecraft Mod Public License&lt;br /&gt;

		============================&lt;/p&gt;

		&lt;p&gt;Version 1.0.1&lt;/p&gt;

	&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;ul style="list-style:none"&gt;
	
&lt;li&gt;&lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; 0.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; Definitions&lt;br /&gt;
   
	--------------

	&lt;p&gt;Minecraft: Denotes a copy of the Minecraft game licensed by Mojang AB&lt;/p&gt;

	&lt;p&gt;User: Anybody that interacts with the software in one of the following ways:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul style="list-style:none"&gt;
		
&lt;li&gt;&lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; -&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; play&lt;/li&gt;
		
&lt;li&gt;&lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; -&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; decompile&lt;/li&gt;
		
&lt;li&gt;&lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; -&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; recompile or compile&lt;/li&gt;
		
&lt;li&gt;&lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; -&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; modify&lt;/li&gt;
		
&lt;li&gt;&lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; -&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; distribute&lt;/li&gt;
	
&lt;/ul&gt;

	&lt;p&gt;Mod: The mod code designated by the present license, in source form, binary
	form, as obtained standalone, as part of a wider distribution or resulting from
	the compilation of the original or modified sources.&lt;/p&gt;

	&lt;p&gt;Dependency: Code required for the mod to work properly. This includes
	dependencies required to compile the code as well as any file or modification
	that is explicitely or implicitely required for the mod to be working.&lt;/p&gt;

	&lt;/li&gt;

&lt;li&gt;&lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; 1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; Scope&lt;br /&gt;
   
	--------

	&lt;p&gt;The present license is granted to any user of the mod. As a prerequisite,
	a user must own a legally acquired copy of Minecraft&lt;/p&gt;

	&lt;/li&gt;

&lt;li&gt;&lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; 2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt; Liability&lt;br /&gt;
   
	------------

	&lt;p&gt;This mod is provided &amp;apos;as is&amp;apos; with no warranties, implied or otherwise. The owner
