        &lt;/li&gt;
        
&lt;li&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;NO WARRANTY&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; 9.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt;
            &lt;p&gt;BECAUSE THE PROGRAM IS LICENSED FREE OF CHARGE, THERE IS NO WARRANTY FOR THE PROGRAM, TO THE
