            equivalent are not considered part of the section titles.
          &lt;/li&gt;
          
&lt;li&gt;
            &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; M.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt;
            Delete any section entitled &amp;quot;Endorsements&amp;quot;. Such a
            section may not be included in the Modified Version.
          &lt;/li&gt;
          
&lt;li&gt;
            &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; N.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt;
            Do not retitle any existing section as &amp;quot;Endorsements&amp;quot;
