    <rdfs:comment>This license is essentially a rebranded version of MPL-1.1, but with some important changes. A new AMENDMENTS section is introduced, which includes an advertisement clause, non-endorsement and no-trademark clauses, as well as product/project naming rules. These changes are summarised in the new §6.4 where it is also explicitly stated that the license is a modificaton on MPL-1.1.</rdfs:comment>
