          &lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;This License&amp;quot; refers to version 3 of the GNU General Public License.&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;p&gt;&amp;quot;Copyright&amp;quot; also means copyright-like laws that apply to other kinds of works, such
