             called a &amp;quot;modified version&amp;quot; of the earlier work or a work &amp;quot;based
             on&amp;quot; the earlier work.&lt;/p&gt;

            &lt;p&gt;A &amp;quot;covered work&amp;quot; means either the unmodified Program or a work based on the Program.&lt;/p&gt;

