             license; they are outside its scope. In particular, the act of running the Work is not
             restricted and no requirements are made concerning any offers of support for the Work.
        &lt;/li&gt;
        
&lt;li&gt;
            &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; 2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt;
