               changes to that component, or a prominent reference to another file that is distributed as
               part of the Derived Work and that contains a complete and accurate log of the changes.
          &lt;/li&gt;
               
&lt;li&gt;
                  &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; c.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt;
