		&lt;p&gt;This Agreement covers contributions to and downloads from the 3D
		Slicer project (&amp;quot;Slicer&amp;quot;) maintained by The Brigham and Women&amp;apos;s
		Hospital, Inc. (&amp;quot;Brigham&amp;quot;). Part A of this Agreement applies to
