&lt;li&gt;
            &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; II)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt;
          It is allowed to distribute a modified (or extended) version of &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .+"&gt; Vim&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt;, including executables and/or
