                 error2.c, symbol2.c, init2.c, soapdoc2.html, and soapdoc2.pdf, httpget.h, httpget.c, stl.h,
                 stldeque.h, stllist.h, stlvector.h, stlset.h.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;p&gt;The Initial Developer of the Original Code is Robert A. van Engelen. Portions created by Robert A.
