&lt;li&gt;
&lt;var class="optional-license-text"&gt; ### &lt;/var&gt;&lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; 4.2. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt;Maintain User Autonomy
